  "notes": "{誕生|たんじょう} means birth or the creation/beginning of something new.\n\nMEANINGS:\n1. Birth (of a person): {赤|あか}ちゃんの{誕生|たんじょう}\n2. Creation/beginning (figurative): {新|あたら}しい{時代|じだい}の{誕生|たんじょう}\n\nVERBAL USE:\n{誕生|たんじょう}する: to be born, to come into existence\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {誕生日|たんじょうび}: birthday\n- {誕生|たんじょう}パーティー: birthday party\n- {生|う}まれる: to be born (more common verb)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- お{誕生日|たんじょうび}おめでとう: happy birthday\n- {新記録|しんきろく}が{誕生|たんじょう}した: a new record was set\n\nNOTE:\nFor everyday \"birth,\" {生|う}まれる is more common. {誕生|たんじょう} is more formal/literary.",
